	"data": "Nanolucent × Matter of Time\n\nThe hidden link: space measured by time, time experienced through space.\n\nThe Surface\n\nNanolucent is a measurement unit — 1 light-nanosecond ≈ 30cm, designed for Room 2.0's coordinate system. Matter of Time is a VR experience set in a photogrammetric bedroom where the room itself is the interface. One is a technical spec for positioning objects in space. The other is a narrative experience that uses a real room as its UI. The connection seems mechanical: nanolucent…",
